/// The data workbook. Local file by default; switch to the SharePoint line when the file lives in SharePoint or OneDrive for Business.
expression Workbook = ```
		let
		    // Local file (Power BI Desktop, or the service through a gateway):
		    Source = Excel.Workbook(File.Contents(DataFile), null, true)
		    // SharePoint / OneDrive for Business (no gateway needed) - paste the file URL into DataFile and use instead:
		    // Source = Excel.Workbook(Web.Contents(DataFile), null, true)
		in
		    Source
		```
